{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a telepath trapped in a small facility whose only means of escape is to take control of the minds of the facility\u2019s staff. The facility is aware of possible telepathic behaviour but is unaware you already have these powers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need to be careful who you speak to, what you say, and how you act. Should the facility staff become too suspicious overall, you\u2019ll be discovered. Unfortunately your powers are also very limited in your current state. You\u2019ll have a limited amount of time in each mind. The stronger the mind, the less time you\u2019ll have. Stay in a mind too long and you\u2019ll cause a psychotic break, which will, of course, lead to your eventual discovery.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance your abilities to keep suspicion low, explore the facility, and uncover the truth about your existence as you find out how to escape from this unknown predicament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3937580?t=1764607347","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3937580?t=1764607347","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937580/6d775bae4d84cb8342a6fe0a69b6026e41e95060/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764607347","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937580/6d775bae4d84cb8342a6fe0a69b6026e41e95060/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764607347","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a telepath trapped in a small facility whose only means of escape is to take control of the minds of the facility\u2019s staff. The facility is aware of possible telepathic behaviour but is unaware you already have these powers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need to be careful who you speak to, what you say, and how you act. Should the facility staff become too suspicious overall, you\u2019ll be discovered. Unfortunately your powers are also very limited in your current state. You\u2019ll have a limited amount of time in each mind. The stronger the mind, the less time you\u2019ll have. Stay in a mind too long and you\u2019ll cause a psychotic break, which will, of course, lead to your eventual discovery.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance your abilities to keep suspicion low, explore the facility, and uncover the truth about your existence as you find out how to escape from this unknown predicament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Creative Guild LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937580/746e935c6b281a74629a6ec3557b8f79645d39c1/header.jpg?t=1764607347","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> any<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 8100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> any<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3937580/1832265067/8de425bf92f0874ee643b70d6d8eaaa33bf9e24a/1761777574/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761778312","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3937580/1832265067/8de425bf92f0874ee643b70d6d8eaaa33bf9e24a/1761777574/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761778312","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3937580/1832265067/8